#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:1
#: 63444c9e58ad4458925593d4968a1f5f
msgid "Hardware interface parameters"
msgstr "硬件接口参数"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:3
#: 89a2b15b8cad41489e93b2ea785aa91f
msgid ""
"ros2_control **hardware plugin** arguments. These are URDF / xacro "
"`<param>` entries under `<ros2_control><hardware>`, loaded in the plugin "
"`on_init`. They are **not** the same API as `ros2 param list` on a "
"controller node."
msgstr ""
"ros2_control **硬件插件**参数。它们是 `<ros2_control><hardware>` 下的 URDF / xacro `<param>`，在插件 `on_init` 加载。与控制器节点上的 `ros2 param list` **不是**同一套 API。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:5
#: 7fccffcfd23646a1816bd5944a614761
msgid ""
"How the launch `hardware:=` key selects a plugin: [ros2_control in This "
"Stack](../../3-concepts/1-ros2_control_here.md). How to inspect "
"controllers vs hardware: [Configure ROS 2 controller "
"parameters](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md)."
msgstr ""
"Launch 的 `hardware:=` 如何选插件：[本栈中的 ros2_control](../../3-concepts/1-ros2_control_here.md)。如何查看控制器 vs 硬件：[配置 ROS 2 控制器参数](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:7
#: 57db4059818a4533935c6773bc47fa7a
msgid ""
"The in-tree [`hardwares/README.md`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/hardwares/README.md)"
" is **build-only** (`colcon build --packages-up-to …`). Parameter names "
"live in each hardware-interface README and in the robot xacro."
msgstr ""
"树内 [`hardwares/README.md`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/hardwares/README.md) 只讲**编译**（`colcon build --packages-up-to …`）。参数名在各硬件接口 README 和机型 xacro 中。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:9
#: 6d2a08ae1d2c43019111c75577cd32ef
msgid "topic_based_ros2_control"
msgstr "topic_based_ros2_control"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:11
#: bc4022c778fd4baebcb7a5239d417aac
msgid ""
"Public plugin used when `hardware:=isaac` (Acone xacro: "
"`/isaac/joint_command`, `/isaac/joint_states`). README: "
"[topic_based_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/hardwares/topic_based_ros2_control/README.md)."
" Source pin: [`9a1da3ba` `topic_based_system.cpp`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/hardwares/topic_based_ros2_control/src/topic_based_system.cpp)."
msgstr ""
"`hardware:=isaac` 时使用的公开插件（Acone xacro：`/isaac/joint_command`、`/isaac/joint_states`）。README：[topic_based_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/hardwares/topic_based_ros2_control/README.md)。源码 pin：[`9a1da3ba` `topic_based_system.cpp`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/hardwares/topic_based_ros2_control/src/topic_based_system.cpp)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:13
#: c42dbe85604548218aab73ea01185148
msgid "Plugin class: `topic_based_ros2_control/TopicBasedSystem`."
msgstr "插件类：`topic_based_ros2_control/TopicBasedSystem`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:15
#: d96716445ab54286a1541ddc7a1b7736
msgid "README example:"
msgstr "README 示例："

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:17
#: 2a402fb90bc0422daaca6ba15b94b829
msgid ""
"<ros2_control name=\"my_system\" type=\"system\">\n"
"  <hardware>\n"
"    <plugin>topic_based_ros2_control/TopicBasedSystem</plugin>\n"
"    <param name=\"joint_commands_topic\">/robot_joint_commands</param>\n"
"    <param name=\"joint_states_topic\">/robot_joint_states</param>\n"
"    <param name=\"initialize_commands_from_state\">true</param>\n"
"  </hardware>\n"
"</ros2_control>"
msgstr ""
"<ros2_control name=\"my_system\" type=\"system\">\n"
"  <hardware>\n"
"    <plugin>topic_based_ros2_control/TopicBasedSystem</plugin>\n"
"    <param name=\"joint_commands_topic\">/robot_joint_commands</param>\n"
"    <param name=\"joint_states_topic\">/robot_joint_states</param>\n"
"    <param name=\"initialize_commands_from_state\">true</param>\n"
"  </hardware>\n"
"</ros2_control>"

