#: 9c3224532719475da351a2edaf8db959
msgid ""
"`true`: first received state becomes the command (avoids a jump). "
"`false`: use state_interface `initial_value`"
msgstr "`true`：用首次收到的状态作为命令（避免突跳）。`false`：使用 state_interface 的 `initial_value`"

