#: e54db81462d242198081eb07a8079fdd
msgid "Strip this prefix from hardware joint names when matching topic names"
msgstr "匹配话题关节名时去掉硬件关节名上的此前缀"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:37
#: 4dc51685a3a4451ba20c55968f3e17dd
msgid ""
"Per-joint `initial_value` on a `state_interface` is used when "
"`initialize_commands_from_state` is `false`. Joint `mimic` / `multiplier`"
" are standard ros2_control joint parameters read at the same `on_init`."
msgstr ""
"当 `initialize_commands_from_state` 为 `false` 时，使用各关节 `state_interface` 上的 `initial_value`。关节 `mimic` / `multiplier` 是同一 `on_init` 读取的标准 ros2_control 关节参数。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:39
#: aad498bd3b834bb480c107ed01925771
msgid ""
"Change any of these by editing the xacro (or the overlay that generates "
"it) and **restarting** the hardware. There is no `on_set_parameters` path"
" in this plugin."
msgstr "要改这些值，请编辑 xacro（或生成它的 overlay）并**重启**硬件。此插件没有 `on_set_parameters` 路径。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:41
#: cda49a0df3f841d98f6d1772e6050254
msgid "Isaac Sim: [Isaac Sim](../../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md)."
msgstr "Isaac Sim：[Isaac Sim](../../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:43
#: 06369b09ceab487d8c230d4f7f9f3d3e
msgid "Other public hardware interfaces"
msgstr "其他公开硬件接口"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:45
#: 4490c35fe0be432899865e98c700b6ee
msgid ""
"Vendor plugins and the `<param>` names already listed on [Public hardware"
" interfaces](1-public_hi.md) (for example ARX `can_interface`, Dobot "
"`robot_ip` / `robot_port`, HighTorque `serial_port`, Modbus `serial_port`"
" / `baudrate`). Those pages are the parameter lists. They are xacro "
"`<param>` values at plugin load — same **Startup (plugin load)** rule as "
"above."
msgstr ""
"厂商插件以及已列在[公开硬件接口](1-public_hi.md) 上的 `<param>` 名称（例如 ARX 的 `can_interface`、Dobot 的 `robot_ip` / `robot_port`、HighTorque 的 `serial_port`、Modbus 的 `serial_port` / `baudrate`）。那些页面就是参数列表。它们是插件加载时的 xacro `<param>` — 规则同上，**启动时（插件加载）**。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:47
#: bf014b45c799400e8cfe1483a4c03bde
msgid "Use the plugin class from that robot’s `xacro/ros2_control/*.xacro`."
msgstr "插件类以该机型 `xacro/ros2_control/*.xacro` 为准。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:49
#: 8fb890b4b6254b0b9a8fc21268581a95
msgid "Private hardware interfaces"
msgstr "私有硬件接口"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:51
#: 45e48e72df9241c2ad8408bf1ba01686
msgid ""
"[Private hardware interfaces](2-private_hi.md) names the private packages"
" (Rokae, Eyou, iNex, Wuji, DexCap, Fairino). Configuration keys, "
"IP/serial layouts, and SDK env vars are in **that repository’s README "
"after access**. This page does not list undocumented private SDK "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"[私有硬件接口](2-private_hi.md) 列出私有包（Rokae、Eyou、iNex、Wuji、DexCap、Fairino）。配置键、IP/串口布局和 SDK 环境变量见**开通后该仓库 README**。本页不罗列未文档化的私有 SDK 参数。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:53
#: 1100eaf0645b4c1d8d23b39bc8970198
msgid "SDK build notes: [SDK Notes](3-sdk_notes.md)."
msgstr "SDK 编译说明：[SDK 说明](3-sdk_notes.md)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:55
#: 5a903655ad1542f38f37fbda50f562af
msgid "OCS2 `.info` files"
msgstr "OCS2 `.info` 文件"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:57
#: d316f169a0ce40438e83329e09e8ef7c
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`{robot}_description/config/ocs2/*.info` (and the generated library under"
" `config/ocs2/generated`) are **OCS2 task / model files**, not ROS 2 "
"parameters. The controller ROS param `info_file_name` (default `task`) "
"only chooses which `.info` to load at startup — [Controller ROS 2 "
"parameters](../controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md)."
msgstr ""
"`{robot}_description/config/ocs2/*.info`（以及 `config/ocs2/generated` 下的生成库）是 **OCS2 任务 / 模型文件**，不是 ROS 2 参数。控制器 ROS 参数 `info_file_name`（默认 `task`）只在启动时选择加载哪份 `.info` — [控制器 ROS 2 参数](../controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md)。"

